# The crash of 2026-11-12 ( "I went from mp_abandon_sh_mk to mp_hunger and the editor crashed" ), as it happens:
# the open map has changes, so the double click in the Maps window asks first; "Discard" then opened the other map
# from inside the question's popup - at the end of the frame, after the 3D view had put its picture into the frame's
# draw list. Closing the map released that picture; drawing the frame used it.
# The pixels belong to the layout the editor is started with ( Maps docked on the left, "Maps only" on ).
map_open mp_abandon_sh_mk
wait 3
ed_box 0 0 0 64 64 64
wait 1
ui_mouse 51 622
wait 0.5
ui_mouse down
ui_mouse up
ui_mouse down
ui_mouse up
wait 1.5
ed_shot $OUT\switch_discard_1_question.png
wait 1
# "Discard"
ui_mouse 1278 713
wait 0.5
ui_mouse down
wait 0.1
ui_mouse up
wait 3
sel_info
expect mp_hunger: 20015 entities
ed_shot $OUT\switch_discard_2_opened.png
wait 1
ui_mouse off
quit
